OL,6,G0300 Julia Bradbury's Wonders of the
OL,7,G     Frozen South
OL,8,     FJulia sails to the rugged island
OL,9,     Fof South Georgia, which rises from
OL,10,     Fthe South Atlantic and has an
OL,11,     Fextraordinary abundance of
OL,12,     Fwildlife and a haunting human
OL,13,     Fhistory. Landing on Salisbury
OL,14,     FPlain, Julia navigates to reach a
OL,15,     Fvast colony of more than 100,000
OL,16,     Fking penguins that crowd the
OL,17,     Fbeach, as well as the whaling
OL,18,     Fstation that became polar explorer
OL,19,     FErnest Shackleton's salvation, and
OL,20,     Fsees some of the largest seals in
OL,21,     Fthe world
